// Every ship weapon, component, missile, mining/salvage part, utility item, paint and flair,
// plus each ship's stock loadout. Some fields are stored in short form to save space:
//   buy: [[locationIndex, price, YYMMDD verified, "c" if from cstone else UEX], ...]
//   COMPONENT_LOCATION_CODES[locationIndex]: the shop's UEX terminal code (null for cstone-only shops)
//   description: index into COMPONENT_DESCRIPTIONS
//   image: "w:<path>" (starcitizen.tools thumbnail)
//   kind: the game's item type ("WeaponGun.Gun"). A slot takes an item when its t lists that
//     kind (or just its type, e.g. "Shield") and the item's size is within s.
//   slots (items and ships): {p: port name, l: label, t: ["Type.SubType"], s: [min, max] size,
//     e: 1 if you can change it, i: stock item id, x: stock part name when it's not in the catalog,
//     c: [slots inside it]}
// common.js expands them. Records in components.data.js override these field by field.
// Data snapshot: game patch 4.10.2, gathered 2026-10-17.

