"The Tatomidae edition features an elegant, metallic, maroon wave-pattern across the sleek, dark hull.",
"Inspired by the hue of a medicinal plant found on Terra, the Aja livery for the Ursa is dark blue with white and grey highlights.",
"Standard livery for the RSI Ursa Rover Fortuna.",
"Equip your Ursa with a paint scheme cooler than a snow storm. The IceBreak livery mixes crisp, cool white with a frostbitten blue for an exciting look suitable for any season.",
"Announce your arrival with the Oasis livery for the Ursa, which is a vibrant teal tint with grey and white accents.",
"Customize your RSI Ursa Rover with this red livery.",
"The Respite is an exclusive livery for the Ursa, which is black and grey with white highlights.",
"Exude attitude with the Skullcrusher livery for the Ursa, which features a massive skull across the top.",
"The Bonanza livery gives the UTV a lustrous look with its gold and black finish.",
"Bright pops of orange stand out against the grey base paint of the Reckoner livery.",
"Light brown and grey camo combine with red highlights for the Resistor Camo livery.",
"The Wilderness Camo livery brings a classic green and grey camo pattern to the UTV with red highlights.",
"Customize your Valkyrie with this special 2950 Best in Show livery that is white with grey and gold accents.",
"Customize your Valkyrie with this livery featuring a light grey color scheme with dark, bold patterns.",
"Customize your Valkyrie with this light green livery.",
"Customize your Valkyrie with this fragmented green livery.",
"The Clawed Steel livery blends several shades of blue for a livery that beautifully breaks up the Vanguard's silhouette.",
"Soar like the winter winds with the Frostbite Camo livery for your Vanguard.",
"Featuring a vibrant blue base color and gold highlights, the Invictus Blue and Gold livery will give your Vanguard a striking style.",
"Proudly proclaim that your Vanguard is a predator with the New Dawn livery. Inspired by the patterns seen in nature, this livery mixes orange and gold with black stripes for a supremely unique look.",
"Fly in style with the Solar Winds livery that gives the Vanguard a metallic silver finish with maroon highlights.",
"Customize your Vanguard with the Timberline livery that's olive green with orange accents.",
"The striking True Valor livery gives the Vanguard a white cockpit, blue body, and yellow tails and fins.",
"Celebrate the Drake Vulture being voted a Best in Show finalist for 2953 with this pearlescent purple and cyan livery.",
"The Abomination livery brings out the Vulture's already brutish features, boasting an asymmetrical arrangement of green and blue paneling to mimic the monsters that still haunt our imaginations.",
"Make them see red! The Assembly livery is a full fuselage red design with black and silver accents that makes sure your spacecraft is easily identifiable during salvage operations.",
"When salvage operations need to be done quietly, the Carbonide livery offers a distinct grey-on-grey alternating layout intended to obscure the spacecraft against a usual starfield.",
"A working salvage crew needs any advantage they can get to be noticed in a busy environment. Enter the Carnival livery, a stunning pink hull with black highlights and distinctive stripes running down the ship's arms.",
"Embrace Day of the Vara mischievousness and mayhem any time of the year with this custom Vulture livery. It combines metallic green and black for a striking look that highlights the holiday's classic colors.",
"Make people weak in the knees by adorning the Vulture with the Hearthrob livery, featuring a shimmering violet paint scheme.",
"Equip your Vulture with a paint scheme cooler than a snow storm. The IceBreak livery mixes crisp, cool white with a frostbitten blue for an exciting look suitable for any season.",
"For the Vulture captain dedicated to a hard day's work, the Longhorn livery's black-and-burnt orange hull with rough silver highlights lend a classic industrial feel to the famed spacecraft.",
"The Oriole livery offers Vulture captains a no-nonsense matte grey toned hull patterned after those operated by military organizations. Understated orange highlights mark the craft's salvage-and-recovery role.",
"This version of the livery has been modified from its original form with the addition of graffiti. Embrace chaos with the Outcast livery. It features rough splashes of neon green against black to give the Vulture an aggressively chaotic appearance.",
"Vulture operators who choose the Pyrite livery never have to apologize for sporting a little style. A stealthy matte black and silver hull contrasts sharply with silver and yellow topped arms.",
"Exude attitude with the Skullcrusher livery for the Vulture, which features a massive skull across the top.",
"With a look inspired by racing ships, the Allegro livery spotlights the sleek, aerodynamic design of the Wolf.",
"The Antilles livery for the Wolf features a vibrant, electric blue base paint and bright red tail section.",
"The Frost Camo livery is crisp white with a subtle camo pattern and grey and red highlights.",
"The Heatsink livery features a two-tone striped blue base paint with bold yellow and red highlights.",
"The HighSec livery gives the Wolf a carbon fiber finish with red accents.",
"The Iceflash livery provides the Wolf a distinct look with grey spots breaking up its grey and white base paint.",
"Stalk your prey with the exclusive Lycan livery, which features a black base and gray fur-like hand-painted details for a monstrous finish.",
"Discreetly soar through the night sky in the Wolf with the Nightbreak livery, which is primarily black with red highlights.",
"Orange highlights provide a bit of color to the gray and black Nighttide Camo livery.",
"Mixing a green camo pattern on the front with a bright yellow back makes the Ranger Camo an attention-getting choice for the Wolf.",
"Complement the elegant design of the Kruger Wolf with the Riftwalker livery, which is primarily black with bronze and blue highlights.",
"Live bright and bold with the stark red of the Rosso livery and ensure that everyone will see the unique beauty of the Kruger Wolf.",
"Brandish a green and brown camo pattern with red and yellow highlights on the Kruger Wolf with the Sylvan Camo livery.",
"Infinity Custom worked with Origin on the Blueshift livery, which is dark blue and black with X1 in vibrant white.",
"Infinity Custom worked closely with Origin to develop the exclusive Scarlet livery, which enhances the striking look of the X1 with bold red accents.",
"Infinity Custom worked with Origin on the Shadow livery for the X1, which is primarily black with grey lettering and orange highlights.",
"Infinity Custom worked with Origin to design the Supersonic livery for the X1. It is grey with orange highlights to accent the vehicle's streamlined design.",
"The ArcCorp livery for the Zeus features the company's logo atop a maroon base paint with black and yellow highlights.",
"Commemorate the Zeus making the final four of the 2955 Ship Showdown with this striking metallic orange and black Best in Show livery.",
"The Crusader livery for the Zeus features the company's logo atop a light blue base paint with black and white highlights.",
"The Hurston livery for the Zeus features the company's logo atop a grey base paint with yellow highlights.",
"Venture forth with the Keelback livery, utilizing a deep blue with contrasting yellow accents.",
"Inspired by the colors of Coramor, the Lovestruck livery is a stylish metallic pink and black look for your Zeus.",
"The microTech livery for the Zeus features the company's logo atop a white base paint with light blue and grey highlights.",
"The Firmament livery makes the Zeus Mk II a beautiful light blue with black and white highlights.",
"The Frontier livery highlights the dynamic angular design of the Zeus Mk II. The white in the front extends into the grey back half of the ship down the center of the fuselage and edge of each wing.",
"Featuring a lush green with yellow and black highlights, the Monteverde livery gives you a colorful option for the Zeus Mk II.",
"The Obsidian livery uses black, white, and a metallic finish to give the Zeus Mk II a distinctly bold look.",
"Primarily orange with a grey central line and highlights, the Solar livery for the Zeus Mk II was designed to match the colors of the iconic Zeus suit variant of the same name.",
"Outfit the ship that launched Humanity into the stars with the gorgeous Solstice livery. Grey and black panels accented by ribbons of gold give the Zeus Mk II a distinguished and unforgettable appearance.",
"The subtle style of the Starscape livery features black and steel-colored panels with orange highlights.",
"Proclaim your presence with the Sunswept livery for the Zeus Mk II, which features a vibrant yellow with black highlights."
